    <section class="references" id="sect-00014">
    <title>References</title>
    <para id="para-00049">Al-Halabi, S., Herrero, R., Saiz, P. A., Garcia-Portilla, M. P., Errasti, J. M., Corcoran, P., Bascaran, M. T., Bousono, M., Lemos, S., &amp; Bobes, J. (2011). A cross-cultural comparison between Spain and the USA: Temperament and character distribution by sex and age. <emphasis effect="italics">Psychiatry Research, 186</emphasis>(2–3), 397–401. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.psychres.2010.07.021</para>
